sequenceDiagram
    participant EP  as EnerPlanET Backend
    participant GW  as Go Gateway (/buem/start)
    participant BM  as BUEM Flask (:5000)
    participant VOL as Shared Volume

    EP->>GW: POST /buem/start<br/>config.json (topology with buem blocks)

    Note over GW: Parse topology<br/>Find BasePOI nodes where<br/>properties.buem ≠ null<br/>Deduplicate by node ID

    par goroutine per building (max 4 concurrent)
        GW->>BM: POST /api/process?include_timeseries=true<br/>GeoJSON FeatureCollection (1 feature)
        BM-->>GW: GeoJSON response<br/>properties.buem.thermal_load_profile<br/>+ embedded hourly arrays
        GW->>VOL: write heating_{lat}_{lon}_{year}.csv
        GW->>VOL: write cooling_{lat}_{lon}_{year}.csv
    end

    Note over GW: Merge enriched buem blocks<br/>back into original topology nodes<br/>Replace arrays with CSV filenames

    GW-->>EP: enriched config.json<br/>(same structure, buem results added)